      "$comment": "1.8.0 optimisation: the next trees out (after the nearTris ones) get a lighter copy of the model (each tree's `mid` triangles, `midFile`, made by scripts/models/trees.mjs --mid) while these many triangles last; the rest stay picture cards. Three steps instead of two: the model does not turn into a card so near the camera. With it the RTS view's near share is 20 000 (was 30 000), so the whole frame stays inside the Low budget (KG-02).",
